<title>UK: Shell cuts Rotterdam refinery crude runs 12-15 pct.</title>
<headline>Shell cuts Rotterdam refinery crude runs 12-15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell has reduced crude throughput at its Rotterdam refinery by 12-15 percent from recent levels of 350,000 barrels per day (bpd) because of poor margins, trade sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The refinery began cutting on the fourth (of March),&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>&quot;They will be watching margins closely and further cuts are not being ruled out&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The cut is equivalent to nearly 50,000 bpd.</p>
<p>Shell Rotterdam refinery has a nameplate capacity of 374,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, 542 4984</p>
</text>
